To expand water accessibility and supply coverage:
To provide potable water and sanitation services to all education and health facilities;
To reduce the number of people drinking water containing excessive fluoride 
To increase the coverage of integrated river basin development
'To build integrated basic sewerage systems for 100 cities and ensure all rural villages to have access to toilets;

