policy_specific_actions_2:
Reduce agro-chemical pollution of water and land;
Establish new and rehabilitate existing agro-processing industries to minimize negative environmental impacts for processing of key agricultural commodities 
Provide government support for installation of recycling facilities for Polyethylene terephthalate (PET), High-Density Polyethylene (HDPE) Low-Density Polyethylene (LDPE) and Polypropylene (PP)
Reduce and mitigate emissions from agricultural systems through converting waste to energy and other green technologies;
