Building capacity for climate change adaptation and mitigation including hazard/disaster risk reduction: a. Promote continuous integration of climate change and disaster risk reduction in planning, budgeting and reporting;
Strengthen the policy, legal and institutional framework for effective disaster risk governance, management and response
Increase availability of and access to multi-hazard early warning systems and disaster risk information to save lives and reduce losses to disasters.
Institutionalize disaster risk planning in Programmes;

